# This repo versions ONLY the Claude Code configuration that lives at the workspace
# root. The workspace also contains memoryful-backend/ and memoryful-frontend/, which
# are their own independent repos and must stay out of this one.
#
# Strategy: ignore every top-level entry, then re-include the config explicitly.
# Adding a new config file at the root means adding a matching `!` line here.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.mcp.json
!/.claude/

# Never commit the personal layer: it holds API tokens (TickTick) and machine-local
# overrides. `.mcp.json` is committed and references ${VARS} that resolve from here.
/.claude/settings.local.json

# Runtime noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
